The ID of each receipt is sent back in the response "ticket" for each notification. In summary, sending a notification produces a ticket, which contains a receipt ID you later use to get the receipt.

The receipts may contain error codes to which you must respond. In particular, Apple or Google may block apps that continue to send notifications to devices that have blocked notifications or have uninstalled your app. Expo does not control this policy and sends back the feedback from Apple and Google so you can handle it appropriately.

